        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SS35U, 3-1/2\" x 3-1/2\" Heavy Duty Grade Stainless Steel Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 3-1/2 Inch Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Hinge comes packaged as a pair of hinges. Please see our <a href=\"/pages/door-hinge-replace-guide-on-sizes\" target=\"new\">Hinge Ordering Guide</a> to see how many hinges you'l need for our door. This 3-1/2 x 3-1/2 x Square Corners Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Hinge Pair is so called because it has a 0.119 inch thickness. Heavy duty hinges need to be mortices deeper into the door than residential hinges. The Deltana SS35U 3-1/2 Inch x 3-1/2 inch hinge features square corners and a removable stainless steel pin. Choose from satin stainless steel or polished stainless steel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS35U.jpg?v=1704354637\" width=\"300\" height=\"335\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SS35Ux Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 3-1/2 Inch Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.119\" (Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #9 x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS35Ux.pdf?v=1704262169\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SS35Ux Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "3-1/2 x 3-1/2 x Square Corners Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Hinge",
                "description": "The 3-1/2 Inch Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Hinge comes packaged as a pair of hinges. This 3-1/2 x 3-1/2 x Square Corners Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Hinge Pair is so called because it has a 0.119 inch thickness. Heavy duty hinges need to be mortices deeper into the door than residential hinges. The Deltana SS35U 3-1/2 Inch x 3-1/2 inch hinge features square corners and a removable stainless steel pin. Choose from satin stainless steel or polished stainless steel.\r\n",
